# Audit Reflog — Scheduled Job

Weekly check for unintended `reset --hard` / `reset to origin/main`. Alerts via macOS notification.

## Locations

| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| Wrapper (with alert) | `unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/run-audit-reflog-with-alert.sh` |
| Audit script | `unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/audit-reflog-resets.sh` |
| Install | `unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/launchd/install-audit-reflog.sh` |
| Watch install | `unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/launchd/install-audit-reflog-watch.sh` |
| Log | `/tmp/audit-reflog.log` |
| Watch log | `/tmp/audit-reflog-watch.log` |

## Run manually

```bash
cd WORKSPACE_ROOT
bash unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/run-audit-reflog-with-alert.sh
```

## Test notification (click opens log, sound)

```bash
terminal-notifier -title "Audit Reflog" -message "Test" -sound default -execute "open /tmp/audit-reflog.log"
```

## Stay until acknowledged

System Settings → Notifications → terminal-notifier → **Alerts** (not Banners).

## Start job (runs every 10 min)

```bash
bash unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/launchd/install-audit-reflog.sh
launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.unified-trading.audit-reflog.plist
```

## Cancel job

```bash
launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.unified-trading.audit-reflog.plist
```

## Event-based watch (fswatch)

Runs audit on `.git/logs` changes (commit, reset, checkout). Requires `brew install fswatch`.

```bash
bash unified-trading-pm/scripts/repo-management/launchd/install-audit-reflog-watch.sh
launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.unified-trading.audit-reflog-watch.plist
```

Stop: `launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.unified-trading.audit-reflog-watch.plist`


## Implementation notes (similar scripts)

- **set -e**: Use `cmd || exit_code=$?` so notification block runs when audit exits 1
- **launchd PATH**: Use full path to terminal-notifier (`/opt/homebrew/bin` or `/usr/local/bin`)
- Reference: `run-audit-reflog-with-alert.sh`

## Ignore format

Per-commit: `repo:hash` (e.g. `deployment-api:b103671`). Audit output shows the exact line to add. Legacy: `repo` only = whole repo.

